你在睡觉吗
Are you asleep?

173
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:25,420
麦克斯 我有话想跟你谈
Max? Max, I really need to talk.

174
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:29,820
直接进来发泄不就得了
Oh, just come in and get it over with.

175
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:30,880
其他人都这样
Everybody else does.

176
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:34,940
抱歉 麦克斯 我真的想跟你谈一下
Max, I'm sorry, but I really need to talk.

177
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:36,860
我去了餐厅附近的算命店
I went to the fortune teller near the diner,

178
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:39,259
她说我这辈子注定一生无爱
and she told me that I'd never find love in my life.

179
00:07:39,259 --> 00:07:41,254
算命都是骗人的把戏
Fortune-telling's a scam.

180
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:43,540
"你的月亮与天王星相位 这辈子都没男人
"You'll never find a man, your moon's in Uranus,

181
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:45,100
天王星上本来就没男人"
no man will ever be in Uranus."

182
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:47,800
我认识你的第二天就能编这些给你听了
I could've told you that the second day I met you.

183
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:50,000
求你了 麦克斯 听我说五分钟就好
Please, Max, just listen for five minutes.

184
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:51,400
过来嘛 我给你泡杯茶
Come over here. I'll make you some tea.

185
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,660
还喝茶 你当我是凯特王妃她妹啊
Tea? Who am I, Pippa Middleton?

186
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:57,180
给我烤个松饼吃吃 我就考虑听听
Toast me an eggo waffle and maybe I'm listening.

187
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,620
我们本来是要留到
Well, we were saving that waffle

188
00:07:58,620 --> 00:08:00,340
特殊时刻才吃的呢 不过好吧
for a special occasion, but okay.

189
00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:04,340
栗宝 我们现在要吃掉你的生日松饼啦
Chestnut, we're eating your birthday waffle now.

190
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,940
真不知道我干嘛还要惹他生气
I don't know why I'm pissing him off.

191
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,820
他可能是我这辈子唯一的男人了
he's gonna be the only man in my life.

192
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:12,600
我真不敢相信你花十块钱去找神婆
I can't believe you blew $10 on a psychic.

193
00:08:13,060 --> 00:08:15,140
你就不能跟其他寂寞的白妞一样
Why didn't you just buy a Skinnygirl margarita

194
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:16,900
买瓶玛格丽塔借酒浇愁吗
like all the other lonely white chicks?

195
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,860
我花了50块
I spent $50.

196
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,880
我还买了一块挡坏运的水晶[音似坏犹太人]
I bought a crystal that protects me from bad juju.

197
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,120
你也不需要因此讨厌犹太人吧
Hey! There's no reason to get anti-semitic.

198
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:28,920
你还花钱买不能吸食的水晶[冰毒]
You spent money on crystal you can't snort?

199
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:30,080
你脑子是哪里有病啊
What is wrong with you?

200
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:33,820
我吓到了嘛 不想要一生无爱
I freaked out. I didn't want it to be true.

201
00:08:34,220 --> 00:08:35,160
会是真的吗 麦克斯
Is it true, Max?

202
00:08:35,180 --> 00:08:36,360
我真的会一生无爱吗
Am I never gonna find love?

203
00:08:36,420 --> 00:08:37,560
安迪是我唯一的希望吗
Was Andy my one chance?

204
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:39,260
我因为想成功而抛弃了唯一的爱吗
Did I screw it up because I wanted success?

205
00:08:39,340 --> 00:08:40,440
大家说的真的对吗
Was everyone right?

206
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:43,220
就给一块松饼 也问太多问题了吧
That is a lot of questions for one waffle.

207
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:46,460
而且那块松饼呢
And where is that waffle?

208
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,000
你在家也是个烂服务员
You're a bad waitress at home too.

209
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,540
这么晚 会是谁啊
Who could that be?

210
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:53,040
不知道 让我请示一下四方神灵
I don't know. Let me consult the spirits.

211
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:54,420
是谁啊
Who is it?

212
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,040
是苏菲
It's Sophie.

213
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:00,740
没错就是我
Yeah, it's me,

214
00:09:00,900 --> 00:09:03,660
有着非法生意的坏女人
The shady lady with the illegal business.

215
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:07,100
卡洛琳 你得给我道歉
Yeah, and Caroline, you owe me an apology

216
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:08,480
要不然我会摘下这耳环
or I will take out these hoops,

217
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,920
