Yeah, and I warn you,

219
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:16,860
我在老家时 可是有不少极限战斗的经验
I did some extreme fighting in Warsaw.

220
00:09:17,700 --> 00:09:19,420
极限战斗 这么酷啊
Extreme fighting? That's awesome.

221
00:09:19,740 --> 00:09:23,040
对啊 他们会把一大块起司丢饲料槽里
Yeah, they would throw a big hunk of cheese in a trough

222
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:25,680
村里的姑娘就会抢上去大打出手
and let all the village girls just go at it.

223
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,500
