Sorry, Sophie.

224
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:30,380
只是当时觉得伪造个签名
It just seemed like a better business decision

225
00:09:30,380 --> 00:09:31,400
会对我们生意比较好嘛
to go with the forgery.

226
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,660
那是什么
What is that?

227
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:36,260
是松饼吗
Is that a waffle?

228
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:40,380
好吧 原谅你了
Okay! You are forgiven.

229
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,614
靠 我连一口都没吃到
Damn it. I didn't even get a bite.

230
00:09:43,614 --> 00:09:46,540
白起床跟忍着不喝酒了
I'm awake and sober for nothing.

231
00:09:46,540 --> 00:09:47,900
苏菲 你相信灵媒吗
Sophie, do you believe in psychics?

232
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:50,120
才不信呢 那是骗人的
Oh, no. That's all fake.

233
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:53,240
我以前认识一个吉普赛灵媒家庭
You know, I knew a family of gypsy psychics

234
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,440
但他们甚至预测不到
who couldn't even predict

235
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:56,320
他们会全家葬身火海
that they would all die in a barn fire.

236
00:09:58,020 --> 00:10:00,160
姑娘们 抱歉打扰
Hey, girls. Sorry to interrupt,

237
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:03,220
苏菲之前答应我要帮我又黄又厚的脚趾甲
but Sophie promised to rub antifungal cream

238
00:10:03,220 --> 00:10:04,570
擦灰指甲药膏呢
on my thick, yellow toenails.

239
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:06,520
奥列格过来吧
Oleg, come over here.

240
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:08,640
我边吃边帮你擦
I'll do it in between bites.

241
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:13,400
你害怕得不到的就是这个吗
This is what you're afraid you're missing?

242
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:15,740
这就是爱情啊
