我的愿望是 你能把钱还给我的朋友
Well, my wish is that you give my friend her money back,

262
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:03,080
我的梦想是
and my dream is that

263
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,520
成为梅西·埃丽奥特的伴舞员
I'm a backup dancer for Missy Elliott.

264
00:11:06,787 --> 00:11:09,380
