And you, tough guy, don't say,

271
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:20,800
"你是神婆你会不知道吗"
"Well, you're the psychic."

272
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:24,800
或许她真的是神婆 因为我的确是个悍妞
Maybe she is a psychic, because I am a tough guy

273
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:25,900
而且我也打算这么说
and I was gonna say that.

274
00:11:27,140 --> 00:11:28,560
我很难记住每个人
You know, it's hard to remember.

275
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:30,660
