I see a lot of sad, single girls.

276
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:32,520
但现在仔细看看你
But looking at you right now,

277
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:33,420
我的话也不无道理
it makes sense.

278
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,440
给
And here.

279
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,200
把你骗人的水晶拿回去
Take your phony crystal back.

280
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:39,160
我连这是不是真水晶都说不准
And I'm not so sure this is a real crystal.

281
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:41,200
这看起来像腋下除臭剂之类的
It looks like one of those vegan deodorant things.

282
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:44,400
