but if you could remove the curse

295
00:12:17,680 --> 00:12:19,740
再顺手把你衣服上的面也弄掉...
and possibly that noodle on your blouse...

296
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:26,460
不是吧 你刚是不是...
Oh, no. Did you just--

297
00:12:26,500 --> 00:12:27,540
顺便诅咒了你
Cursed you too.

298
