因为我睡了她男人 而诅咒我下地狱
I was going to hell for sleeping with her boyfriend.

308
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:57,240
也没事啊
But I didn't.

309
00:12:57,340 --> 00:12:58,840
最后还跟他一起出席了返校派对呢
I just ended up going to homecoming with him.

310
