317
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:16,240
他在楼顶干嘛啊
And what is he doing on the roof?

318
00:13:19,180 --> 00:13:19,740
好吧
Okay.

319
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:23,600
是保罗这个人掉下来
That was paul's life that came crashing down,

320
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,240
不是我们
not ours.

321
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,440
麦克斯 我们都知道
Max, I think we all know that

322
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:33,140
我是一名高学历女性
I'm a highly educated woman

323
00:13:33,140 --> 00:13:34,640
不相信诅咒这种事
who doesn't really believe in curses,

324
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:36,660
但今晚我要把我们挣的每一分钱
but I am putting every penny we make tonight

325
00:13:36,660 --> 00:13:37,820
都放进"解除诅咒"基金里
in the "lift the curse" Fund.

326
00:13:38,300 --> 00:13:40,620
我再跟你说最后一遍
And I'm gonna tell you one more time,

327
00:13:41,020 --> 00:13:42,580
我们不会为了某个愚蠢的诅咒
we're not spending another 50 bucks

328
00:13:42,580 --> 00:13:43,780
再多花50块钱
on some stupid curse.

329
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:46,640
一个人从天上掉下来啊
A body fell from the sky!

330
00:13:48,580 --> 00:13:50,600
保罗倒霉吃到烂迷幻蘑菇
Paul got a bad batch of shrooms.

331
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:52,140
跟诅咒一点关系都没有
It had nothing to do with the curse.

332
