人人都知道不应该在二楼以上
Everyone knows you don't take psychedelics

333
00:13:54,940 --> 00:13:56,200
吃迷幻药
above the second floor.

334
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:59,040
业余的倒霉蛋
Poor amateur bastard.

335
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:02,600
我们需要钱来买必需品 比如食物
And we need our money for essentials, like food

336
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:05,240
和我在一元店看见的那企鹅像
and the penguin statue I saw at the dollar store.

337
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,820
上面写着"冷爆了"[冷静]
The one that says "Chill out."

338
00:14:09,420 --> 00:14:10,620
所以 冷静
So chill out.

339
00:14:12,220 --> 00:14:14,120
卡洛琳 我觉得很内疚
Caroline, I feel bad about

340
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:15,920
没帮在你的推荐信上签名
not signing your letter of recommendation.

341
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:18,820
所以我自己写了一封 名字也签好了
So I wrote one myself and signed it.

342
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:19,300
给
Here.

343
00:14:19,780 --> 00:14:21,540
你真好
That's so nice of you.

344
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:24,540
"工作超级努力的卡洛琳·钱宁
"The extremely hardworking Caroline Channing,

345
00:14:24,540 --> 00:14:26,460
把人生全部奉献给事业
who has devoted her life to business

346
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:28,380
心无旁骛 身无旁人"
and nothing and no one else."

347
00:14:30,140 --> 00:14:31,460
阿憨 这封信是要写苦苦求财
Han, this is supposed to be about getting a loan,

348
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:32,860
而不是写哭哭求爱
not being alone.

349
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:35,020
我完全明白 妹子
I totally get it, girl.

350
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,240
我也形影自守
I'm alone as well.

351
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:38,020
为求商场得意 努力不懈
We have our eyes on the prize,

352
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,380
因此情场失意 床上空虚
so our beds are empty.

353
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:42,000
但我偶尔也会花钱找人陪睡哦
But occasionally, I pay for it.

354
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:50,180
刚才阿憨暗示了
Did Han just intimate

355
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:52,260
他偶尔会花钱叫鸡吗
that he occasionally gets a hooker?

356
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:55,340
这幸运的小淫棍
Lucky bastard.

357
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,920
估计他叫鸡还有儿童折扣呢
He probably gets a child's discount.

358
00:15:02,620 --> 00:15:05,360
麦克斯 看 不幸的未来已经开始了
Max, look. The future's already happening.

359
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:07,040
连在阿憨的信里 我都是孤身一人
Even in Han's letter, I'm alone.

360
00:15:07,260 --> 00:15:08,900
我现在最能接近爱情的方法
The only chance for a love life I have now

361
00:15:08,900 --> 00:15:10,760
就是跟阿憨分摊招妓费用
is going halfsies on a hooker with Han.

362
00:15:11,260 --> 00:15:13,519
我们必须得解除诅咒
We have to reverse the curse now.

363
00:15:13,519 --> 00:15:16,900
新闻快讯 人人都是被诅咒的倒霉蛋
News flash: everybody is cursed.

364
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:18,820
去年你万贯家财没了
You lost your money last year.

365
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:22,340
严格说来 我身上从来没发生过好事
Literally nothing good has ever happened to me.

366
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,920
阿憨从四年级就没长过个子
Han hasn't grown since the fourth grade.

367
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,740
奥列格的脚趾甲看起来像薯片
Oleg's toenails look like Fritos.

368
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:31,860
厄尔生在美国史上
And Earl was born black

369
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:33,640
黑人最惨时代中
at the eighth or ninth-worst time

370
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:35,020
排行第八或第九的年代
to be a black man in America.

371
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:39,380
你看清楚吧 这里就是诅咒之谷
Look around, it's the valley of the damned.

372
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:42,040
你举出一个没被诅咒的人啊
Name one person who isn't cursed.

373
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:43,320
伙计们
Hey, guys!

374
00:15:43,740 --> 00:15:46,280
我刚在人行道上捡到100块
I just found a $100 bill on the sidewalk!

375
00:15:47,460 --> 00:15:48,979
我请所有人喝酒
Drinks for everyone!

376
00:15:48,979 --> 00:15:51,877
麦克斯 把那瓶高级白兰地打开
Max, pop open the fancy brandy.

377
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:54,260
你要是同意让我在店里装根钢管
"Fancy brandy" is gonna be my stripper name

378
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:55,380
"高级白兰地"就会是我的艺名哦
if you ever let me put in that pole.

379
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:57,940
苏菲 跟你说哦
Sophie, guess what?

380
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,800
我们回灵媒那控诉她
We went back to that psychic to complain,

381
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,580
结果她对我们俩下诅咒了
and she put a curse on us.

382
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:05,360
你们俩被诅咒啦
Oh. You're cursed?

383
00:16:15,660 --> 00:16:19,020
但就像你说的 白痴才信 对吧
But it's stupid, like you said, right?

384
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:22,420
对对 白痴才信
Yeah, yeah. That's stupid.

385
00:16:23,260 --> 00:16:24,020
没错
Yeah.

386
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:26,240
她有提到我的名字吗
Did she mention me?

387
00:16:28,380 --> 00:16:29,140
没啦
No.

388
00:16:30,020 --> 00:16:31,960
她只是对我们下咒 然后说
She just cursed us and said

389
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:34,680
不给钱 我们周围的人事物都会掉下来
our whole lives would come crashing down around us.

390
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:47,200
30 40 50块
and 30, 40, 50.

391
00:16:48,400 --> 00:16:49,420
诅咒解除了
The curse is lifted.

392
00:16:50,740 --> 00:16:53,160
你好像没弄到我 那我的诅咒呢
Oh, I don't think you got me. What about my curse?

393
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:57,420
做戏做全套
Talk about phoning it in.

394
00:16:57,660 --> 00:16:59,580
你不能挥舞个羽毛还是转转头
Couldn't you wave a feather or spin your head

395
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:00,520
甚至是呕吐一下之类吗
or throw up or something?

396
00:17:01,540 --> 00:17:02,500
那要额外收费
That's extra.

397
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,500
其实呢 我今晚心情很不错
You know what? I'm in a good mood tonight.

398
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:09,320
我今天只抽了15根烟
I got through the whole day on 15 cigarettes

399
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:10,300
吃了一整个大蛋糕就满足了
and one sheet cake.

400
00:17:10,940 --> 00:17:13,700
我送一次免费塔罗算命给悍妞吧
I'm gonna give tough guy a free reading here.

401
00:17:14,500 --> 00:17:17,600
免费是指付50块后免花费吗
Oh, free, as in the $50 you just shook us down for?

402
00:17:21,740 --> 00:17:24,380
一开始就不应该试着戒烟
Should never have quit. Okay.

403
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:27,000
你的未来马上就能算出
Future coming right at you.

404
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,720
我看到了你会有个快乐人生
I see that you will have a happy life.

405
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,800
我 快乐吗
Me, happy?

406
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:33,640
母亲 戴上帽子 我们可以走人了
All right, get your hat, mother. We're leaving.

407
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:37,700
还有很大一笔钱将要入你手
And I see a large sum of money coming your way.

408
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:39,360
一万元以上哦
Over $10,000.

409
00:17:39,740 --> 00:17:41,040
麦克斯 是那个拨款
Max, it's the grant.

410
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,420
我们申请了一万二 是这个吗
We applied for $12,000. Is that it?

411
00:17:43,700 --> 00:17:44,020
当然
Sure.

412
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:49,060
尽管你有个悲惨的童年
And in spite of your bad childhood...

413
00:17:49,060 --> 00:17:50,700
她知道你有悲惨的童年耶
She knew you had a bad childhood.

414
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:52,860
拜托 谁的童年不悲惨
Come on, every childhood is bad.

415
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,420
又小又笨 总够不着东西
You're stupid. You can't reach stuff.

416
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:54,940
超悲催啊
It's rough.

417
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:58,060
尽管如此
In spite of it,

418
00:17:58,500 --> 00:18:01,340
我看到你的未来有爱人与儿女相伴
I see great love and children in your future.

419
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:03,120
麦克斯
Max.

420
00:18:04,540 --> 00:18:05,740
我吗 等等
Me? No, wait.

421
00:18:05,740 --> 00:18:07,380
你是不是接收到她的未来啦
You must be picking up on her vibes.

422
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:07,980
再检查一下
Check again.

423
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:11,800
没 就是你有爱人与儿女
No, great love and children

424
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,200
在未来伴你左右
will be part of your future.

425
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:17,300
她会孤独终老
She will die alone.

426
00:18:19,040 --> 00:18:20,740
够了 我受不了了
Okay, well, that's all I can take.

427
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:22,800
我不要在这坐等下一个保罗掉下来
I'm not gonna sit here and wait for the other Paul to fall.

428
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:24,500
-走吧 麦克斯 -别别别
- Let's go, Max. -No, no, no, no.

429
00:18:24,500 --> 00:18:25,280
别走 等等
No, no. Wait.

430
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:28,700
她绝对是算错了 对吧
She obviously got it wrong. Didn't you?

431
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:32,560
没 她就是会孤独终老
Nope. Still dying alone...

432
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:35,380
但是会在事业上取得大成功
with nothing but her great success.

433
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,060
抱歉 没听清 你再说一遍
I'm sorry, I'm sorry. What?

434
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:39,900
我看到了你的未来会有大成功
I see great success in your future.

435
00:18:40,380 --> 00:18:42,780
真的吗 谢天谢地
You do? Oh, thank God.

436
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:45,480
我会功成名就吗 多成功啊
I'm gonna have success? How big a success?

437
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:46,680
亲爱的 超级成功
Oh, honey, it's so big,

438
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,200
成功到你都意识不到自己有多孤独
you won't even know you're alone.

439
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,220
好啦 你们走吧
All right, go.

440
00:18:55,220 --> 00:18:58,540
祝你们长命百岁 一生健康
May you live a long and healthy life.

441
00:18:58,600 --> 00:18:59,980
记得带上帽子手套
And put on your hat and gloves.

442
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:01,560
我预测要下雪了
I'm predicting snow.

443
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:09,080
才不会下雪呢
It's not going to snow.

444
00:19:09,420 --> 00:19:11,680
顶多也就是30岁男人们如雨坠落
At most, it's gonna rain 30-year-old dudes.

445
00:19:12,220 --> 00:19:13,800
她也不是多灵嘛
Maybe she isn't so psychic.

446
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:15,540
不要不信邪了 麦克斯
Stop fighting it, Max.

447
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:17,260
你会找到爱人然后过得开心
You're gonna find love and be happy,

448
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:18,800
而我会超级成功
and I'm gonna be successful.

449
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,180
你听到了吗 纽约
You hear that, New York?

450
00:19:20,260 --> 00:19:22,520
我将要功成名就 然后孤独终老
I'm gonna be successful and alone!

451
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:27,560
你再喊 就要被人先抢后奸了
And robbed and raped if you keep calling that out.

452
00:19:27,560 --> 00:19:29,140
而成功的就是从我把
And it all started when I dropped

453
00:19:29,140 --> 00:19:31,100
拨款申请表投入
that grant application into that mailbox

454
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:33,780
那正被拆除带走的邮筒开始的
that those guys are unbolting and taking away.

455
00:19:34,060 --> 00:19:34,760
怎么回事
What's going on?

456
00:19:35,500 --> 00:19:36,680
听过电邮吗
It's called emails.

457
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:39,160
我们要把邮筒拆了 现在都没人寄信了
We're getting rid of this. No one mails anything anymore.

458
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:41,560
有啊 我昨天才投进去呢
Yes, they do. I did yesterday.

459
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:43,640
我们的一万二就靠那封信了
And our $12,000 depends on it.

460
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:44,560
抱歉啦 美女
Sorry, doll.

461
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,940
这邮筒已经除役一周了呢
This box has been out of commission for a week.

462
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:49,320
而根据神婆说的 她下面的"邮筒"
According to a psychic, her box is gonna be

463
00:19:49,320 --> 00:19:50,320
将"除役"一辈子呢
out of commission forever.

464
00:19:51,780 --> 00:19:52,560
这必须得跟他们说啊
We had to tell him.

465
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:54,440
你想我骗政府公仆吗
You expect me to lie to a city employee?

466
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:57,700
看来我们是得不到那笔拨款了
So I guess we're not getting that grant.

467
00:19:58,140 --> 00:19:59,940
那灵媒说错了
The psychic was wrong.

468
00:20:00,380 --> 00:20:02,580
她说的估计没一样会实现
Maybe nothing she said is gonna come true.

469
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:04,440
我都说了 那是骗人的
I told you, it's a scam.

470
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:07,740
麦克斯 你瞧
Max, look.

471
00:20:08,120 --> 00:20:09,580
下雪了
It's snowing.

472
00:20:09,580 --> 00:20:11,340
她预测会下雪呢
And she predicted snow.

473
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:13,840
妈的 我会有小孩啊
Oh, crap! Am I gonna have kids?

474
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:17,820
她雪预测对了 但钱却没有
So she was right on snow, but not on the money.

475
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:19,960
这样怎么算啊
So what is it?

476
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:22,760
我到底会还是不会孤独终老啊
Am I or am I not gonna die old and alone?

477
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:24,900
我们谈这个干嘛啊
Why are we even talking about this?

478
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:26,840
我们都不知道活不活得过这冬天
We're probably not gonna make it through the winter.

479
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:30,840
对了 如果你先死了
if you die first,

480
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:32,254
我绝对会吃你哦
I am totally eating you.

481
00:20:32,254 --> 00:20:34,626
我知道你会的
Oh. I know.

482
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:36,240
而且
And besides,

483
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:38,440
没人能鱼与熊掌兼得啦
no one person can get it all.

484
00:20:39,060 --> 00:20:39,740
你说得对
You're right.

485
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:42,420
一个人不行 那两个人呢
No one person can, but what about two?

486
00:20:42,860 --> 00:20:44,560
你有爱人与孩子
You'll have the love and the kids

487
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:45,520
而我有成功
and I'll have success.

488
00:20:45,580 --> 00:20:47,940
我们可以分享啊 就像我们现在分小费
Maybe we can share, like we share our tips

489
00:20:47,940 --> 00:20:50,080
或像我们分享你枕套里发现的饼干一样
or that wheat thin we found in your pillowcase.

490
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:52,600
你是想跟我以后的爱人上床吗
Are you asking to bang my great love?

491
00:20:52,820 --> 00:20:55,120
我是无所谓啦 我到时肯定也是腻了他
Which is fine with me, becaue I'm already bored

492
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:56,400
然后开始睡他的牌友
and sleeping with his poker buddy.

493
00:20:57,500 --> 00:20:58,740
这样吧 我们交换
In fact, let's switch.

494
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:01,280
你可以拿走我的爱人 让我来孤独终老
You can have my great love, and I'll die alone.

495
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:03,460
麦克斯 你不会想孤独终老的
Max, you don't want to die alone.

496
00:21:03,460 --> 00:21:07,210
我但求孤独一死啊
I am dying to die alone.
